# Story-estimate log written by /estimate-story — local only by default.
# One JSONL line per estimate under archive/YYYY/MM/. It records levels,
# never people, but it is still the team's planning data, not pack content.
#
# IMPORTANT — additive patterns only, never negations (`!pattern`).
# A .gitignore deeper in the tree outranks .git/info/exclude, so a negation
# here would silently re-include files and defeat a trial-mode install.
# Enforced by unit-gitignore-hygiene.sh.
archive/
